{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36177","headline":"题睦州郡中千峰榭 · 方干","name":"题睦州郡中千峰榭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岂知平地似天台，朱户深沈别径开。\n曳响露蝉穿树去，斜行沙鸟向池来。\n窗中早月当琴榻，墙上秋山入酒杯。\n何事此中如世外，应缘羊祜是仙才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36177.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36177","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}